  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖，越往深處走，恐魚的數量越多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果不能快些會合......會很危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老師......我要怎麼......才能像她們一樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嘎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "海嗣......？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（是在甲板上見到的那隻，那個獵人的一擊居然沒對它造成一點傷害......？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（......會怎麼攻擊？四肢？啃咬？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（不，手炮，我必須拉開距離，我——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，等等！你腰間的，你掛著什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你為什麼會......你難道是......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗷啊啊啊啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃！咳咳——咳咳——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（這個力度——！幸好擋下了——！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......伊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你想說什麼嗎？怪物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不會......也不可以在這裡倒下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是，伊比利亞的審判官！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_183",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_183",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "燒毀溟痕花費了太多時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_183",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......並不樂觀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐魚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_457_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（成群的窸窣聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（從這裡可以看見下面的情況......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已經幾個小時了？大審判官閣下......還能堅持得住嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......如果我......不，別想這些，喬迪，注意力集中點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4042_lumen_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "審判庭......快啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼了，就這樣而已？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_458_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嘎......嗷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽啊，你的同夥們已經在發出哀嚎。鹽風城的那朵小花至少有些美感，可你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "作為睡醒後的第一堂舞蹈課，實在乏味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_458_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘎......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "它要逃了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我去追，你去找那個伊比利亞的小鳥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#4",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "你現在感覺如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好得很，記憶就像星海墜下的瀑布。還需要花點時間才能看見自己的全貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過稍有些喘不過氣的，就是回想起這些年的事情，有些讓人很不好意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "......你的狀態還不穩定，我去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼，要和我搶獵物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "它會想辦法逃進海裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它當然會，但是，它剛才明顯不是因為打不過我們而選擇逃跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它發現了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "我們沒時間——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳......咳咳......！還是沒能控制好手炮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別跑，你究竟——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——嗯？深海獵人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "早啊，艾麗妮。很高興你又給我們帶來了一隻獵物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你喊我艾麗妮？你......你恢復記憶了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還不能完全這麼說，但我現在確實狀態極佳，心情愉悅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "不是說這些的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "這一隻，是甲板上那隻。它的反應速度連二隊長的刺擊都能避開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真厲害，面對這樣的對手，你竟然能毫髮無傷地把它驅趕到我們身邊，我該誇誇你，艾麗妮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，並不是我驅趕它的結果，它幾乎沒有發動過攻擊——哪怕現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊......我還以為像這樣漏洞百出地聊聊天，它就按捺不住襲擊的欲望了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您的朋友剛剛離場，現在追上去還不算太晚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是說，您也是個和平主義者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（卡西米爾，斯卡蒂曾經落腳的內陸國家。廣袤的草原與林地，騎士之國。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（騎士......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是偶然嗎？還是有什麼東西，吸引著他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這艘船，布雷奧甘，你想給家鄉留下什麼？你把答案藏在了哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（恐魚的屍骸？不光如此......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（乾淨俐落的傷口，這些恐魚甚至沒有反抗的跡象。氣味混雜在一起，這裡的空氣過於混濁。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（這艘船上......還有什麼？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你腰間的腰帶和懷錶毫無疑問屬於人類，而且是伊比利亞的制式！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你究竟是什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它在拖延時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "等另一隻回到海裡，會很麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是不打算發起攻擊嗎......真是消極的舞伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "斯卡蒂，配合我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——咕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......咕......咕啊啊啊......咕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們都砍傷它了欸，它再不還手，我都替它覺得委屈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "......不對！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "它不是在給同伴拖延時間！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鐘、鐘聲？！什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（刺耳的尖嘯）——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "鐘聲迴蕩在空無一人的黃金大廳。\n大廳的燈光一一閃爍，在三人分神的瞬間，海嗣落在了王座的方位。\n王座。\n這艘伊比利亞的大船上，竟然有一座王座。傲慢的結晶，權力的果實，愚昧文明的幫兇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它就像......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幽靈鯊沒有繼續說下去，因為她自己也覺得這太過荒謬。\n它頭戴王冠，披著與簾幕同樣的顏色。它靜靜半跪在王座一旁，看得出，它是王座最親暱的對象。\n像是舊日的王后與近臣，侍奉著伊比利亞黃金的太陽。\n從王座後走出一個人。\n艾麗妮將提燈舉過頭頂，想要照亮陰影，提前看見那人的全貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼，要踏上，我的船？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳......咳咳咳......啐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......回答我，回答，偉大的，阿方索，你們是來做什麼的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼，要打破寂靜，來找這艘幾十年，無人問津的，“我的伊比利亞”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就從你開始，回答，舊伊比利亞人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "艾麗妮不可置信。\n她見過海嗣的那張臉。在這樣的年紀成為審判官，她少不了勤勉學習。熟讀經卷，銘記歷史，讓信條成為力量。\n這個海嗣自稱阿方索？\n它自稱是伊比利亞最偉大的船長？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——你，你不可能是這艘船的船長！怪物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "六十年前的阿方索船長就已經年近半百，你的模樣甚至比那時的英雄還要年輕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "艾麗妮知道自己在動搖。但她不能這麼軟弱。\n她條件反射般提起了燈，如同她的長官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卸下你的偽裝！海嗣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "燈火搖曳。比起金色大廳的光芒，審判官手裡的微小燈火，反而更吻合失落一詞的含義。\n黃金的時代。\n“海嗣”在凝視艾麗妮片刻後，不屑地轉過頭，微微輕蹭“阿方索”早已非人的那隻胳膊。\n沉默短暫地籠罩在英雄的四周。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......“海嗣”？壞稱呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "舊伊比利亞人，告訴我你的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "伊比利亞審判官，艾麗妮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“舊伊比利亞”，可笑。我不容許你玷污伊比利亞的名譽，我會——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你膽敢用這種語氣和我說話？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（打斷說話聲的尖嘯）——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在我們焚燒維多利亞的艦隊，把獅王的榮譽扔進湖底的時候，你在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在我親手把船載的赤金鋪滿整座鹽風城的時候，你在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在軍團大陣像黑雲一樣遮蔽萊塔尼亞的晨曦時，你又在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（劇烈的咳嗽）咳咳咳——咳咳，啐，呸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是阿方索，舊伊比利亞的公爵，大艦隊的總指揮，斯圖提斐拉號的船長，我自己的王。你呢？不值一提的審判官，你膽敢質疑我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......（不滿地微微搖頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無知的國教會已經跨過大海找到我啦，難道要我誇誇你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "回去吧，無論你們怎麼來的。“愚人號”不歡迎你們。加西亞......我的好大副，別和她們計較。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你流的血，她們很快就會千倍奉還。還給這片海。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......（點頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "侮辱審判庭在伊比利亞是重罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你聽不懂我說的話嗎？離開。這艘船上的人已經死絕了，舊伊比利亞人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（咆哮）我們付出這麼多的代價——！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——不是來徵求，你的同意的......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聒噪......再一次見到國教會的人，讓我更加討厭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "重罪？連面對懦弱的王族都無可奈何的國教會嗎？哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......如果你真的是從舊伊比利亞來的，那麼現在，國教會的教宗是誰？卡門嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......！你知道聖徒閣下的名字......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聖徒？聖徒......噗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，聖徒？哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你、你笑什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他不害臊嗎？他難道連成為教宗的勇氣都沒有嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "難怪你們花了六十年才找到這裡，看來災難讓舊伊比利亞懦弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......但是，無妨。老船醫在變成珊瑚前，和我推測過舊伊比利亞的現狀，我談論過很多可能......我早猜到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在，你們所踩踏的地板，這座一塵不染的金色大廳，這裡才是我的記憶裡的祖國。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡才是伊比利亞！而你嘴裡的國度狹隘至極，只有你願意看見和瞭解的那部分，啐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "曾幾何時敢橫跨內陸的國家已經如此懦弱了嗎？懦弱到你們花了六十多年，才找到我這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿方索走下臺階。\n艾麗妮向後退了一步。手中的提燈一陣搖曳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......那麼，為什麼還有兩個阿戈爾人？我的伊比利亞不歡迎阿戈爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#14$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無意冒犯，船長先生，我們只是追殺一些令人作嘔的怪物，將您和您的大副和它們混淆了罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "......你是怎麼在這裡活得這麼久的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你可問到重點了，阿戈爾蠢貨。我和它的狩獵遊戲持續了很久很久，今天，或者是明天，本該是收獲的日子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可你們趕走了我的獵物，我們又得靠那些——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——不，等等......等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......你不是阿戈爾人。不止是阿戈爾人！你們都不是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你叫什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "......斯卡蒂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不。不不不不，阿戈爾人，別騙我，我們被囚禁在這艘船上幾十年，但我們不傻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它們叫你，Ishar-mla。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......聽見鐘聲了嗎，烏爾比安？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這艘船還有能動的部分，真是個奇跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在這兒，鐘聲意味著狩獵的開始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰是獵人？誰是獵物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "海洋的子民不在乎這些，如果他們把那位阿方索認定為同胞——虛弱的同胞，他們甚至願意主動獻上部分血肉，確保強大個體的存活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有一個獵人向這裡來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "歌蕾蒂婭。她太敏銳了，陸地上學來的伎倆管用不了太久，很快她就會發現我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你打算怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你打算怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "反問我嗎？我......我挺想看看你的選擇，烏爾比安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我曾經以為自己不會再對深海獵人產生興趣。勞倫緹娜讓我著迷，我在她身上看到了可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而你，你自發地做出了選擇，還保持理智。你有自覺嗎？獵人先生，你就快和我們沒有區別了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你能接近真相嗎？拋棄神諭，剖開神的軀體，理解海中諸神的真相？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你追求的答案太過迷人，連我都想知道。呵呵，瞧瞧，我還會好奇呢。真遺憾，這說明我還像個人類。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "神諭，刻在其子嗣的本能之中。從一開始，我們思考的方式就背道而馳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哎呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這話......可比我還要接近海嗣喔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
